{
  "title": "Kitchen Dense Saudi Arabian Bread Rolls Casserole",
  "description": "A rich and satisfying Saudi Arabian dish featuring bread rolls, saute, and a blend of spices, perfect for a crowd. This shojin-friendly recipe is sure to please.",
